<title>UK: Merrill Lynch adds 100 bln lire to two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch adds 100 bln lire to two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Credito Italiano and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT   *400 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    05.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     5 BP	PAY DATE  **10.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES   10 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    100.0</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINAL 300 BLN LIRE LAUNCHED 13.FEB.97</p>
<p>	    **PLUS 30 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> LISTING    LON	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE 40 DAYS AFTER PAY DATE</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
